  "instructions": [
    "heat the coconut oil in a large pan over medium heat",
    "add the barramundi fillets and fry for 3-4 minutes on each side until cooked through",
    "remove the barramundi from the pan and set aside",
    "add the ferment-jang, turmeric, paprika, cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper to the pan and stir to combine",
    "return the barramundi to the pan and coat with the spice mixture",
    "serve the barramundi on top of cooked quinoa",
    "garnish with chopped fresh herbs if desired"
